  << /ActualText (June 2006 \023 September 2006 \174 Stanford\054 CA\nResearch assistant studying how future self perception shapes decision\055making in the present\054 showing an early passion for helping people make better decisions\056 \nErsner\055Hershfield\054 H\056\054 Garton\054 M\056T\056\054 Ballard\054 K\056\054 Samanez\055Larkin\054 G\056R\056\054 \046 Knutson\054 B\056 \0502009\051\056 Don\031t stop thinking about tomorrow\072 Individual differences in future self\055continuity account for saving\056 Judgment and Decision Making\054 4\0504\051\054 280\055286\056\nErsner\055Hershfield\054 H\056\054 Wimmer\054 G\056E\056\054 \046 Knutson\054 B\056 \0502009\051\056 Neural evidence for selfcontinuity in temporal discounting\056 Social Cognitive and Affective Neuroscience\054 4\0501\051\054 85\05592\056)
