1575 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Great design leadership starts with knowing where you\047re going\054 why\054 and saying it until everyone around you is saying it too\056 I lead with clarity and conviction\054 care deeply about the craft and the people doing it\054 and believe my job is to create the conditions for great work to happen\054 not to have all the answers\056 I\047m drawn to complex systems and the challenge of making them feel simple and coherent\054 especially products that help people achieve their goals in their life\056 In a world where building is cheap but craft is rare\054 great design is a genuine differentiator\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1576 0 R
     /Pg 1534 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
