1581 0 obj
  << /ActualText (June 2022 \023 Present \174 Zurich\054 Switzerland\nLeading a global team of 30\053 designers\054 researchers\054 visual designers\054 and content designers through a transformation of YouTube Studio\056 Identified the need to pivot the product from a generic container of features into a true creative partner\054 re\055organized the team around that vision\054 and architected a multi\055year roadmap including a complete overhaul of the app\047s information architecture\056 The vision and systems we built unlocked significantly faster execution across 40 partner teams\056 Now leading the team through a major AI transformation with Ask Studio\056 Results\072 100M\053 creators served\054 2x growth in mobile usage\054 10\045 YoY increase in uploads\054 20\045 YoY growth in weekly active channels\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 1582 0 R
     /Pg 1534 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

