1585 0 obj
  << /ActualText (November 2018 \023 June 2022 \174 Zurich\054 Switzerland\nLanded a complex multi\055year migration from Studio Classic to the new YouTube Studio covering hundreds of features\054 a decade of technical and design debt\054 and a creator base that couldn\047t afford disruption\056 We transformed the mobile experience to support the next generation of creators\056 Then built the platform foundations\072 design system\054 documentation\054 resources\054 and partner support\054 giving teams across YouTube shared language and scaffolding to move with confidence\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1586 0 R
     /Pg 1534 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

