1589 0 obj
  << /ActualText (May 2016 \023 November 2018 \174 Zurich\054 Switzerland\nRelocated to Zurich to lead Gmail\047s UX team\054 gaining the global perspective that\047s shaped how I\047ve worked ever since\056 Drove the Gmail add\055ons platform\054 enabling hundreds of third\055party partners to build powerful integrations into one of the world\047s most\055used productivity tools\056 Built a scalable design system spanning web\054 iOS\054 and Android\054 foundational work used by billions of people\056 Closed this chapter with an exploratory vision for AI and assistive tools in the workplace\054 much of which is becoming reality today\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 1590 0 R
     /Pg 1534 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
